{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38908","headline":"秋日泊浦江 · 杜荀鹤","name":"秋日泊浦江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一帆程歇九秋时，漠漠芦花拂浪飞。\n寒浦更无船竝宿，暮山时见鸟双归。\n照云烽火惊离抱，剪叶风霜逼暑衣。\n江月渐明汀露湿，静驱吟魄入玄微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}